Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-pyqt5 | python3-pyside6, katu-core, katu-release
Priority: optional
Section: misc
Description: Katu Central — Control Panel
 Main control panel for Katu OS. Provides a dashboard with real
 system status and quick access to all Katu applications:
 updates, drivers, store, AI, security, backup, devices,
 diagnostics and help.
